      "correct": "4",
      "solution": "**Given**\n\n8 of 64 + [(3 × 8) + (6 - 3 × 4)] + 4 = ?\n\n**Concept used**\n\nFollow the BODMAS rule according to the table given below:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/df943cc4170c7a296e8113b00d73088e2569bdd501160bcb77ae9722356bc09c.png] \n\n**Calculation**\n\n8 of 64 + [(3 × 8) + (6 - 3 × 4)] + 4\n\n⇒ 8 × 64 + [(24 + (6 - 12)] + 4\n\n⇒ 512 + [24 - 6] + 4\n\n⇒ 512 + 18 + 4\n\n⇒ 512 + 22\n\n⇒ 534\n\n**∴ The value of ? is 534.**",
