      "solution": "**Given:**\n\n9 ÷ [5 + 7 ÷ {9 + 9 ÷ (9 + 9 ÷ 4)}] = ?\n\n**Concept Used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/42bb4721cca13c7a34266d1bfbf6127eca9333c261e2e7b7a1cf02e43d5d169d.png] \n\n**Calculations:**\n\n9 ÷ [5 + 7 ÷ {9 + 9 ÷ (9 + 9 ÷ 4)}]\n\n= 9 ÷ [5 + 7 ÷ {9 + 9 ÷ (9 + (9)/(4))}]\n\n= 9 ÷ [5 + 7 ÷ {9 + 9 ÷ ((45)/(4))}]\n\n= 9 ÷ [5 + 7 ÷ {9 + 9 × (4)/(45)}]\n\n= 9 ÷ [ 5 + 7 ÷ { 9 + (4)/(5) }]\n\n= 9 ÷ [ 5 + 7 × (5)/(49)]\n\n= 9 ÷ [ 5 + (5)/(7) ]\n\n= 9 × (7)/(40)\n\n= (63)/(40)\n\ntherefore **The Required simplified value is (63)/(40)**.",
