      "correct": "3",
      "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression: [41 × {36 of 4 ÷ (96 of 2 ÷ 24)}]\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nBODMAS/BIDMAS (Brackets, Orders (i.e. powers and square roots, etc.), Division and Multiplication, Addition and Subtraction)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nSimplify inside the innermost brackets first:\n\n96 of 2 ÷ 24\n\n⇒ 96 × 2 ÷ 24\n\n⇒ 192 ÷ 24\n\n⇒ 8\n\nNow simplify the next part inside the curly braces:\n\n36 of 4 ÷ 8\n\n⇒ 36 × 4 ÷ 8\n\n⇒ 144 ÷ 8\n\n⇒ 18\n\nFinally, multiply by 41:\n\n41 × 18\n\n⇒ 738\n\n**The value of [41 × {36 of 4 ÷ (96 of 2 ÷ 24)}] is 738.**",
      "tags": [
        "Simplification"
      ]
    },
